  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONPAH Intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Confederation of Indigenous Peoples of Honduras (CONPAH), supporting the construction and consultation of a national Law on Titling, Conflict resolution and Governance in indigenoues terrtiories. Accompanying the nine peoples in Honduras at a technical, political and legal level, relying on a team of lawyers and following up on processes such as ancestral claims in territories, positioning on threats such as the illegal road in La Moskitia, oil and generating approaches and national dialogues to accompany the indigenous struggle and reunify the leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
